2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (A\040method\040for\040parallel\040scheduling\040of\040multi\055rate\040co\055simulation\040on\040multi\055core\040platforms)
/Author (Salah\040Eddine\040Saidi\054\040Nicolas\040Pernet\054\040Yves\040Sorel)
/Subject (The\040design\040of\040cyber\055physical\040systems\040is\040a\040complex\040process\040and\040relies\040on\040the\040simulation\040of\040the\040system\040behavior\040before\040its\040deployment\056\040Such\040is\040the\040case\054\040for\040instance\054\040of\040joint\040simulation\040of\040the\040different\040subsystems\040that\040constitute\040a\040hybrid\040automotive\040powertrain\056\040Co\055simulation\040allows\040system\040designers\040to\040simulate\040a\040whole\040system\040composed\040of\040a\040number\040of\040interconnected\040subsystem\040simulators\056\040Traditionally\054\040these\040subsystems\040are\040modeled\040by\040experts\040of\040different\040fields\040using\040different\040tools\054\040and\040then\040integrated\040into\040one\040tool\040to\040perform\040simulation\040at\040the\040system\055level\056\040This\040results\040in\040complex\040and\040compute\055intensive\040co\055simulations\040and\040requires\040the\040parallelization\040of\040these\040co\055simulations\040in\040order\040to\040accelerate\040their\040execution\056\040The\040simulators\040composing\040a\040co\055simulation\040are\040characterized\040by\040the\040rates\040of\040data\040exchange\040between\040the\040simulators\054\040defined\040by\040the\040engineers\040who\040set\040the\040communication\040steps\056\040The\040RCOSIM\040approach\040allows\040the\040parallelization\040on\040multi\055core\040processors\040of\040co\055simulations\040using\040the\040FMI\040standard\056\040This\040approach\040is\040based\040on\040the\040exploitation\040of\040the\040co\055simulation\040parallelism\040where\040dependent\040functions\040perform\040different\040computation\040tasks\056\040In\040this\040paper\054\040we\040extend\040RCOSIM\040to\040handle\040additional\040co\055simulation\040requirements\056\040First\054\040we\040extend\040the\040co\055simulation\040to\040multi\055rate\054\040i\056e\056\040where\040simulators\040are\040assigned\040different\040communication\040steps\056\040We\040present\040graph\040transformation\040rules\040and\040an\040algorithm\040that\040allow\040the\040execution\040of\040each\040simulator\040at\040its\040respective\040rate\040while\040ensuring\040correct\040and\040efficient\040data\040exchange\040between\040simulators\056\040Second\054\040we\040present\040an\040approach\040based\040on\040acyclic\040orientation\040of\040mixed\040graphs\040for\040handling\040mutual\040exclusion\040constraints\040between\040functions\040that\040belong\040to\040the\040same\040simulator\040due\040to\040the\040non\055thread\055safe\040implementation\040of\040FMI\056\040We\040propose\040an\040exact\040algorithm\040and\040a\040heuristic\040for\040performing\040the\040acyclic\040orientation\056\040The\040final\040stage\040of\040the\040proposed\040approach\040consists\040in\040scheduling\040the\040co\055simulation\040on\040a\040multi\055core\040architecture\056\040We\040propose\040an\040algorithm\040and\040a\040heuristic\040for\040computing\040a\040schedule\040which\040minimizes\040the\040total\040execution\040time\040of\040the\040co\055simulation\056\040We\040evaluate\040the\040performance\040of\040our\040proposed\040approach\040in\040terms\040of\040the\040obtained\040execution\040speed\056\040By\040applying\040our\040approach\040on\040an\040industrial\040use\040case\054\040we\040obtained\040a\040maximum\040speedup\040of\0402\05691\040on\040four\040cores\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402019\054\040Oil\040\046\040Gas\040Science\040and\040Technology\040\205\040Revue\040d\220IFP\040Energies\040nouvelles\054\040Co\055simulation\054\040Speedup\054\040Mutual\040exclusion\054\040Multi\055core\040processor\054\040Scheduling\040\050computing\051\054\040French\040Institute\040of\040Petroleum\054\040French\040Institute\040for\040Research\040in\040Computer\040Science\040and\040Automation)
>>
endobj
